# Truffle artifacts are build output, but the three Phase 2 contracts are
# tracked: their `networks.42161` record is what makes migration 02's
# `overwrite: false` reuse the live mainnet deployment instead of deploying a
# second ConditionalTokens from a clean checkout.
build/*
!build/contracts/
build/contracts/*
!build/contracts/ConditionalTokens.json
!build/contracts/Fixed192x64Math.json
!build/contracts/LMSRWithTWAPFactory.json
